{
  "_": [
    "One entry per short. The engine (engine/short.mjs) supplies the layout, the",
    "beat runner, the countdown and the end card; draws/<slug>.js supplies the",
    "figure. Adding a short is a draw function plus an entry here.",
    "",
    "RULE: every 'line' must set on ONE line at 62px inside the 920px measure,",
    "which is about 28 characters. verify_layout.mjs fails the build otherwise.",
    "",
    "sweep is the reveal: the scalar the draw reads as C.p. For the pieces lifted",
    "from the interactive pages it is the same parameter the viewer dragged."
  ],
